\subsection{Definitions and mathematical statement}
\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
For each admissible weak finite-range interaction of the nearest-neighbor square-lattice Ising model, does its Dobrushin interface at the physical critical coupling converge to chordal $SLE_3$ in every bounded marked Jordan domain along every admissible full mesh limit?

